   [.CX cache0 k0]++cachedMapped2 cache1 cache2 (b1::b2::b3::bs) (y1::y2::y3::ys) (k1::k2::ks) k0++
    mappedEraseCarry b0 y0 cin k0++mappedSum b0 y0 cin
